              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o vidro — \"the glass (material); the car window\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ela abre o vidro do carro porque está calor. She opens the car window because it is hot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Uma garrafa de vidro — a glass bottle. A drinking glass is um copo."
